<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Osem 1996 net 74.9 mln shekels.</title>
<headline>Israel's Osem 1996 net 74.9 mln shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osem Investments Ltd reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>			    (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			  Q4 96	Q4 95    12-MTH 96   12-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenues	     370,677     N/A	1,314,812   1,223,877</p>
<p>Operating profit    19,949     N/A	   88,247     102,858</p>
<p>Net Profit	    20,614     N/A	   74,913	74,532</p>
<p>The company confirmed the 1996 results and said a full report would be published on Thursday.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.37 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
